OL,4,BFour Midlands teams in the             
OL,5,BChampionship top five - can it last?   
OL,6,GIt is beginning to look a lot like     
OL,7,GChristmas for followers of Midlands    
OL,8,Gfootball.                              
OL,10,FGranted, it is actually only November, 
OL,11,Fbut with more than a third of the 2026-
OL,12,F27 Championship season gone, already   
OL,13,Fthe table is taking on an increasingly 
OL,14,Ffamiliar weekly look in terms of the   
OL,15,Fprimary promotion contenders.          
OL,17,FThere has been many a year when there  
OL,18,Fhave been early-season stirrings in    
OL,19,Fthe Midlands, only for the momentum to 
OL,20,Ffade.                                  
